<figure id="S3.F2" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.05941v1/figs/esm_results.png" id="S3.F2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/195;" width="381" height="195" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span>Successful protein structure prediction using the auto-generated ESM MCP service’s agent interface within Claude-Code. The AI agent seamlessly processes a user’s request, demonstrating the end-to-end functionality and simplicity of the converted tool.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Code2MCP automates this entire integration process. As shown in Table <a href="#S3.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 3.1 Core Performance Evaluation: A Quantitative Analysis of Speed and Cost ‣ 3 Evaluation ‣ Code2MCP: A Multi-Agent Framework for Automated Transformation of Code Repositories into Model Context Protocol Services" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, the framework completed the conversion in just 10 minutes. It successfully analyzed the repository, identified core functionalities, and generated a fully encapsulated MCP service. This reduces the once-complex workflow to a single, intuitive tool call, as shown in Listing <a href="#LST2" title="Listing 2 ‣ Tackling Complexity: Automating the esm Library ‣ 3.2 Case Study Deep Dive: From Complex APIs to Autonomous Repair ‣ 3 Evaluation ‣ Code2MCP: A Multi-Agent Framework for Automated Transformation of Code Repositories into Model Context Protocol Services" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. This case demonstrates how our framework’s automated code analysis and synthesis stages effectively abstract away significant domain complexity, which is key to its high efficiency. The final generated service executed flawlessly, as shown in Figure <a href="#S3.F2" title="Figure 2 ‣ Tackling Complexity: Automating the esm Library ‣ 3.2 Case Study Deep Dive: From Complex APIs to Autonomous Repair ‣ 3 Evaluation ‣ Code2MCP: A Multi-Agent Framework for Automated Transformation of Code Repositories into Model Context Protocol Services" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST2" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
